{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "43715165096847f794f0908908cf80f777acfd9768f54c710ff1abcef13a4c1b", "ja": "情報収集のため、酒場にやってきた瑞希達。\n男達のハートを撃ち抜きつつ、サポートセン\nターへ連絡する流れに。直後、深紅の騎士に\n襲われるが酒場の男達に助けられジュリア達\nと合流、危機一髪で逃げ出すのだった。", "zh": "为了收集情报，瑞希等人来到了酒馆。\n一边击穿男人们的心，一边联系支援中\n心。就在这之后，她们遭到了深红骑士的\n袭击，但在酒馆男人们的帮助下与茱莉亚等\n人会合，千钧一发之际逃了出去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_04_1000_null", "source_sha256": "7e4c6c9a671a8eabe7d633a77c59dc4e6373df53cb32a1443bbceba1f6db39c0", "ja": "―フルダイブ型VRゲーム（？）　たまり場の酒場―", "zh": "―完全潜行型VR游戏（？）　聚集据点的酒馆―", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_04_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "678b1c3f66b668a73873f874dcdac85162a8a2a85cbb7e8dbf3f8287b04cd123", "ja": "ええと……すごく大人っぽいお店ですけど、\nわたし達が入ってもいいんでしょうか……？", "zh": "那个……这家店感觉很成熟，我们进去真的没问题吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_04_1002_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e391d239494d3d18a8c4291bcf58514500da535d6fa5cb7c094e3f7ec32e9bb7", "ja": "ゲームだからいいんじゃないかな？\nでも、あんまりかわいいお店じゃないかも。", "zh": "因为是游戏，应该没问题吧？\n不过，这家店可能没那么可爱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_04_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "9d754b31e287b27a86c052a0389b3f5f73d1ef8f976210f56483c14f2d3799eb", "ja": "こういう酒場での情報収集は、RPGの基本です。\nへいマスター。情報プリーズ。", "zh": "在这种酒馆收集情报可是RPG的基本。\n嘿，老板，麻烦提供点情报。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_04_1004_masuta", "source_sha256": "930d387718e751df29794477b371f707acc5bcf0e5299a2e76cfd3160f465da3", "ja": "おっと、冷やかしは困りますよ。\n何か注文してください。", "zh": "哎呀，光看不买可不行哦。\n请点些什么吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_04_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "19d77c3ea48f9cd528cc2f9756a070db1ea026d365e6df53e397ec8ce4417f6b", "ja": "わかりました！　じゃあわたしは、えっと……\nダージリンのミルクティーをお願いします！", "zh": "好的！那我就要……那个……\n请给我一杯大吉岭奶茶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_04_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "998bcbe5a12c035bd9b29bef6a98f37cb52549f6101507246209cda9ace12cf3", "ja": "では私は、マスターおすすめのカクテルを。\n……ノンアルでお願いします。", "zh": "那么我就来一杯店长推荐的鸡尾酒吧。\n……请做成无酒精的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_04_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "12ea485020becaaef7ca86f509ae90effe4ee2cbe1a7af3c8e3095a354634a16", "ja": "わたしは～……キャラメルラテ♪\nかわいいラテアート、描いてくださいね～！", "zh": "我想要～……焦糖拿铁♪\n请帮我画上可爱的拉花哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_04_1008_riizentokyaku", "source_sha256": "d362fcf3ee945d7bc189ad20a016bf3d42b0b755f8011fc0686b0d54240f58ca", "ja": "おいおい、お嬢ちゃんたち……。\nここは酒場だぜ？　わかってるか？", "zh": "喂喂，小姑娘们……  \n这里可是酒馆啊？知道吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_04_1009_mohikankyaku", "source_sha256": "323b44c6ef25f15c489a83f8e658cc7832a7f27343447046021321148f053fd5", "ja": "ハードボイルドな雰囲気が台無しになっちまうだろ？\nまったく、これだからお子様は……。", "zh": "不就把这种硬派氛围给毁了吗？\n真是的，所以说小孩子就是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_04_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "065dc54e8b3f73b984b8119c5d371e0550de46653aff80c3d5b87a346257b7e8", "ja": "おじさん達、キャラメルラテ嫌いなんですか？\n美味しいのに～……あ、ひと口飲みます？", "zh": "叔叔们不喜欢焦糖拿铁吗？\n明明很好喝的～……啊，要不要喝一口？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_04_1011_riizentokyaku", "source_sha256": "cf037c80a983367cfd77a06893128470e26f3d57d5499457f119b4eab6be6927", "ja": "わ、よく見たら超カワイ……！　いやいやいや！\n悪いが、クールなハードボイルドはラテを飲まないぜ。", "zh": "哇，仔细一看超可爱……！不对不对不对！\n抱歉，酷酷的硬派男子可不喝拿铁。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_04_1012_044miz", "source_sha256": "658065daa68f112a898bfec58d248f5cb072a15f1e16c840e09faaef43af86b9", "ja": "なるほど、クールなハードボイルド……やってみます。\n……この銃とノンアルだけが友達さ、ベイビー。", "zh": "原来如此，冷酷的硬汉风……我试试看。\n……这把枪和无酒精饮料就是我唯一的朋友，宝贝。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_04_1013_mohikankyaku", "source_sha256": "79ff25b8bc5cea7258eecec47041a88e74c5924fb3df365770bb1d748e431bdd", "ja": "！　なんてクールなんだ！", "zh": "！真是太酷了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_04_1014_022ser", "source_sha256": "93a882bb5c1924736d38644a85602d990869e550bcd4f1ea0c7578413aadc314", "ja": "あの……わたし、こういうお店に慣れてなくて。\nなにか失礼があったら、ごめんなさい……。", "zh": "那个……我不太习惯这种店。\n要是有什么失礼的地方，对不起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_04_1015_022ser", "source_sha256": "4fea75a07302545a745fe9b63195351c6653dbc89055764afb2a5c3cbd1f9489", "ja": "でも、よかったら一緒に、アフタヌーンティーは\nいかがですか？　少しだけでも、お話ししたいです！", "zh": "不过，如果您不介意的话，要不要一起喝下午茶？哪怕只聊一会儿，我也想和您说说话！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_04_1016_rizrntomohikan", "source_sha256": "489dbe9a1f85e48e930a3d5097d7dcfd47cdfc674614356c40c6525a01efa5ba", "ja": "「「ずきゅーん！！」」", "zh": "““砰——！！””", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_04_1017_044miz", "source_sha256": "8945bfcbccbe8181f587661e07acb528065c699e17ecff3e23876e0835072560", "ja": "……というわけで、私たちは、\n気が付いたらこの町にいたのです。ビックリ。", "zh": "……事情就是这样，我们\n一回过神来，就已经在这个城镇里了。吓了一跳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_04_1018_riizentokyaku", "source_sha256": "48b742a74ba5a1341a6cee5fac35c30087f8517c6db395772bcdca4701db46e0", "ja": "で、ログアウトもできないって事か。\nいや、そんなのあり得ないはずなんだけどな？", "zh": "所以，也就是说连退出登录都做不到吗。\n不，应该不可能有这种事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_04_1019_022ser", "source_sha256": "55e098d8d5edd5d8fcb72863333f8845dbd88658babf550f1ac287d7136f992d", "ja": "でも、本当なんです……どうすればいいんでしょう？\n劇場のわたし達が、目を覚ますには……。", "zh": "可是，真的就是这样……该怎么办才好呢？\n剧场里的我们，要怎样才能醒过来呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_04_1020_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5cca67d4143a6bdb6b36c4fe7f2086896f54d2d09b9f047aabb1cad6d438c7d4", "ja": "うーん……あっちで寝て、こっちに来るんだから……。\nこっちで寝たら、あっちで起きるとか？", "zh": "嗯……既然在那边睡着后会来到这边……  \n那在这边睡着的话，就会在那边醒来？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_04_1021_044miz", "source_sha256": "9f05540bb2786c308bb8032511cf4bfaf612203dd0da056827f8676b68ea0b49", "ja": "伊吹さん、ナイスアイディアです。\nさっそく試してみましょう。……ぐぅ。", "zh": "伊吹小姐，这是个好主意。\n我们马上试试看吧。……呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_04_1022_044miz", "source_sha256": "208547607390b330e47ad90ac142a3900ee261c6163bddd187eeb1651169ba71", "ja": "……ダメです。\nそんな急には眠れません。", "zh": "……不行。\n没法这么快就睡着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_04_1023_riizentokyaku", "source_sha256": "549bc541453bd2ce4c0fba987d2b6d083d4b70448361221e0ec286b1cbf7a131", "ja": "いや、プレイ中の意識は端末が管理してるんだ。\nだから意味ないと思うぜ。", "zh": "不，游玩时的意识是由终端管理的。\n所以我觉得没有意义。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_04_1024_mohikankyaku", "source_sha256": "c721f3385846845e734e2c22303ece522e69898c6c04b3a7207e9d19c6b08496", "ja": "だよな。\nちなみに、もうサポートに連絡とかしたのか？", "zh": "是吧。顺便问一下，你已经联系过客服了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_04_1025_044miz", "source_sha256": "04824d86c53a487e7530f8d148890904d472db20d2d467c447aa6811785a2631", "ja": "おっと……そうでした。ありがとうございます。\nすぐにメールしてみます……。", "zh": "哦……对了。谢谢你。\n我马上试着发邮件……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_04_1026_044miz", "source_sha256": "292d3df4ded47adcd6939b4b1f22c689d2b0a543abe3bd89cde4e6b87580f149", "ja": "……。\nはい、送信完了です。", "zh": "……。\n好了，发送完毕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_04_1027_se", "source_sha256": "a40330c4564d47ecd9ea95b291f1fd27052d6cbf4b598955f5cb2aea2c6b6a6a", "ja": "ザザッ……ザーッ……ヴンッ！", "zh": "沙沙……沙——……嗡！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_04_1028_sinkunoskishi", "source_sha256": "25e5724a7ac26798bc9f197a14cebb14b7b1d8476bd40cc26bc9e3dd7e073ec5", "ja": "……。規約違反行為が確認されました。\n調査・検証のため、あなた方の身柄を拘束します。", "zh": "……已确认存在违规行为。\n为了进行调查与验证，现将拘留各位。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_04_1029_044miz", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_04_1030_016tsu", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_04_1031_022ser", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_04_1032_se", "source_sha256": "adbca577f6e616e698fa510569a4679bd35c894ee83d3a79e253505e369e432b", "ja": "ドン、ドンドン！　パラララララッ！", "zh": "咚、咚咚！哒啦啦啦啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_04_1033_016tsu", "source_sha256": "62eec05b47a9045daf89aa31980b4991537b950638986e720ccceb8984483af5", "ja": "うう～瑞希ちゃん、ダメかも！　相手が強すぎるよ～！\n撃っても撃っても効かない～！", "zh": "呜呜～瑞希，可能不行了！对手太强了啦～！\n怎么打都对她没用～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_04_1034_022ser", "source_sha256": "c24c1a4cfee0f39eb7928dad9bb470482f540c1b86de2581709b05b992f4d6d3", "ja": "撃った弾が全部、自分で避けていくみたいです……！\nどうすれば勝てるんでしょうか？", "zh": "打出去的子弹好像全都自己躲开了……！\n要怎样才能赢呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_04_1035_sinkunoskishi", "source_sha256": "87e8ec0994057a7aa13f311998ad86f967fcca8ea8f32c7bd9d74cad37486276", "ja": "絶対防壁、展開中……これより反撃を開始します。\n近くのプレイヤーは退避してください。", "zh": "绝对防壁，展开中……从现在起开始反击。\n请附近的玩家撤退。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_04_1036_044miz", "source_sha256": "ccaeb49f684b4958f26d85fa1f446be33ee8798fe19872993c0689894e3a1a3f", "ja": "……こうなったら、私が突撃します。\nおふたりは、そこを攻撃してください……レディ。", "zh": "……事已至此，就由我来突击。\n两位请攻击那里……Ready。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_04_1037_se", "source_sha256": "3dc399f3ece866d8dc827bd4e1faa17379d122a5630d6a6841bcfd6ec315725a", "ja": "バーンッ！", "zh": "砰——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_04_1038_050jul", "source_sha256": "12dcffcb058d2edb2744296d1de0741abc3b8b5f478de82407ab2e7bdf7297ab", "ja": "ダメだ、ミズキ！　そいつには勝てない！", "zh": "不行，美月！赢不了那家伙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_04_1039_016tsu", "source_sha256": "362aec199aa7f41397357a520809d0d326a183a238cafcf949253e8734f207da", "ja": "あーっ、ジュリアーノ！？　琴葉さんも！\n助けに来てくれたの？", "zh": "啊——，茱莉亚！？　琴叶也来了！\n你们是来救我的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_04_1040_050jul", "source_sha256": "e04cc321befbeee4dbf3e1b6600417c28f02bfd0ca2ef27209b5f76089a0826e", "ja": "違う！　逃げてきただけだ！", "zh": "不是！我只是逃到这里来的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_04_1041_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0abc647d96c1a012636791aeed870368e9c998157ff486a8840117808e9dedf5", "ja": "え～～～っ！？", "zh": "咦～～～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_04_1042_017kth", "source_sha256": "631b8b29d0a7e2e2d9768780c708122042b9caa1ff17b4cdf1e00733e3641c0c", "ja": "ごめんね、詳しい話は後で！　急ごう！", "zh": "对不起，详细情况之后再说！快走！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_04_1043_044miz", "source_sha256": "7930a760ce2e05189f97bb1909cb89d9141dc8c1d7d648ab8d63e0cdb7abcd28", "ja": "ですがジュリアさん、田中さん。\n逃げようにも隙が……。", "zh": "可是，茱莉亚，田中小姐。想逃也找不到空隙……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_04_1044_riizentokyaku", "source_sha256": "2355c74bfc1aab024df9a20fb759356950c888d3cc309fb7121cb84a7e3dfd47", "ja": "だったら……ほら行けよ、お嬢ちゃんたち。\nオレたちが時間を稼いでやるぜ！", "zh": "既然这样……你们几个小姑娘，快走吧。\n我们来帮你们争取时间！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_04_1045_mohikankyaku", "source_sha256": "30e645620ac3f2b72941c2db465964cef544b7377c6b4818b33a5e47451147a4", "ja": "アフタヌーンティーを楽しませてくれた礼だ。\n次はキャラメルラテも飲ませてくれよな！", "zh": "这是答谢你让我享用了下午茶。\n下次也让我喝焦糖拿铁吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_04_1046_rizrntomohikan", "source_sha256": "a432b0b481d2bd5b600ab49db510e4d7c2ee4f6595f146d3f6d302f38d08a971", "ja": "「「いくぜ！　ハードボイルド！！」」", "zh": "「「上吧！冷硬派！！」」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0222_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0222_story_04_1047_016tsu", "source_sha256": "6a9ac8be182ccd8d21ae3161bf7aa669633eb1233f3d795a2b92e2f6b0051da3", "ja": "おじさん達……！\nありがと～！　大好き～！", "zh": "大叔们……！\n谢谢你们～！最喜欢你们了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
